Vendored third-party code, used ONLY by the gas benchmarks of this directory.

Upstream : https://github.com/dojoengine/origami (crates/algebra)
Commit   : 1ddafcb8c33fe9697c4a44e0557967026d4eeba8 (v1.1.2, 2025-09-23)
License  : MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 Dojo (see LICENSE)

Why vendored: the crate compiles with Cairo 2.19.4 as a git dependency but is UNUSABLE from
another crate: it declares `edition = "2024_07"` (visibility enforced) while `lib.cairo` has
private modules (`mod matrix; mod vec2; mod vector;`) and every struct / trait / impl / field is
private (E2099 "Item `origami_algebra::matrix` is not visible in this context").

Local changes (visibility only, no logic change):
  - src/lib.cairo: `mod x;` -> `pub mod x;`
  - src/matrix.cairo, src/vector.cairo, src/vec2.cairo: `pub` added on the structs, their fields,
    the traits, the impls and the `errors` modules.
  - Scarb.toml rewritten: the `cubit` dependency (upstream: github.com/bengineer42/cubit, branch
    bump-cairo-gt-2.8) points to the vendored ../cubit; it is only used by origami's own tests.
